<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.98 FROM 12.03 PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.98 FROM 12.03 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month eased to 11.98 from 12.03 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) for the same period slipped to 11.48 from 11.53 percent.</p>
